  <title>Kassir</title>
  <description>
    A Tauri v2 desktop cashier application (Point of Sale) for Windows. Manages
    products, transactions, customers, cash flow, and analytics. Offline-first:
    SQLite (data.db) is the source of truth, fronted by an Effect services layer
    (src/services/) that components subscribe to. Includes thermal receipt
    printing, role-based access (admin/user), and multi-cashier login. A
    timestamp-based cloud sync layer exists but is not wired into the UI yet —
    see &lt;sync_system&gt;.
  </description>
  <backend_docs href="backend-docs/openapi.yaml" />
  <version>6.5.0</version>
  <language>id</language>

