    </error_boundary>

    <auth_module>
      <description>
        src/lib/auth.ts is now only the two Tauri bridges — hash(password) and verify(password, storedHash), both
        Effect-wrapped invokes of the Rust commands — plus the Unauthenticated error. The session itself lives in the
        auth service (src/services/auth/): persisted under the localStorage key "user" through the hidden
        local-storage service, validated with a Zod schema { id, name, role }, and checked against the cashiers table
