    <shared_components>
      <component name="useStream">Subscribes a hot Stream (a service's changes) to React state and returns a Result; interrupts the fiber on unmount.</component>
      <component name="useQuery">useStream plus a factory and deps, re-subscribing when they change. keepPrevious holds the last value while a refetch is in flight and flags it refetching.</component>
      <component name="useMutation">Runs an Effect on demand (submits, dialogs) and tracks pending/error/data; mutate resolves with an Either.</component>
      <component name="Loader">Renders a Result: init → fallback (delayed 200ms so fast loads do not flash), error → throws to the nearest boundary, success → children. LoaderMany does the same for several results at once.</component>
      <component name="createErrorBoundary">Builds a React error boundary for one or more Data.TaggedError subclasses; the fallback receives the typed error and non-matching errors rethrow to an ancestor boundary. createManyErrorBoundary takes several.</component>
      <component name="AdminOnly">Role guard: children for admins, otherwise a Redirect to `fallback`.</component>
      <component name="Redirect">Redirect helper (hash-router aware, optional hard reload).</component>
