        The right pane opens the record in full from its identity band (`Lihat`, at the top right — the shelf is only
        reached at the end of a long ledger, so the way out cannot live there), copies it back into a fresh cart with
        `Jadikan Transaksi` (transaction.add.fromRecord: the same rebuild `unsubmit` does, minus undoing the record, which
        opens on /pos for a sale and /restock for a purchase with `?draft=` naming the copy), and — admin only — deletes it
        from the shelf.
