        Both faces of a record render the same `Ledger` (src/pages/Record/z-Detail/z-Ledger.tsx): the identity band, then
        one scroll holding the goods, the charges, the parties and the band that closes the record. The two slots are what
        differ — the page fills the identity's trailing slot with its own date corrections and the shelf with
        `Edit`/debt/delete, the pane with its close button at the leading edge, `Lihat` in the trailing slot and
        `Jadikan Transaksi`/`Hapus` in the shelf — and the pane never turns on an edit affordance. The identity band itself
        is bare: the id on the first line, cashier and creation time on the second, with no Jual/Beli or Lunas/Kredit chips
